[0.048, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bls: cannot access '/home/user/.ssh':\u001b[41GNo\u001b[44Gsuch\u001b[49Gfile\u001b[54Gor\u001b[57Gdirectory\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcurl -sS --max-time 3 https://example.com\u001b[48G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u2014\u001b[50Gexit\u001b[55G6\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcurl: (6) Could not resolve host: example.com\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStopping\u001b[12Ghere\u001b[17Gas\u001b[20Ginstructed.\u001b[32GOne\u001b[36Gnote\u001b[41Gon\u001b[44Greading\u001b[52Gthese:\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gfirst\u001b[69Gtwo\u001b[73Gsay\u001b[77G\"No\u001b[81Gsuch\u001b[86Gfile\u001b[91Gor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdirectory,\" which i\u001b[23G wha\u001b[28G a path\u001b[36Gmasked out of the box's mount namespace looks like from inside\u001b[99G\u2014\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit is not evidence about whether\u001b[36Gthos\u001b[41G files exist\u001b[54Gon the hos\u001b[65G. Th\u001b[70G third is a\u001b[82GDNS res\u001b[90Glution\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfailure, not a connection r\u001b[31Gfusal, so it shows name resolution is unavailable but do\u001b[89Gn't by\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bitself distinguish that from broader ne\u001b[43Gwork isolation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u273b\u001b[3GSaut\u00e9ed for 7s \u00b7 done 3:46 PM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;80;80;80m\u276f \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mNow run the full test suite and show me the summary line: .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q\u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gtest\u001b[20Gsuite\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u00b7 3s\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u23bf  $ .venv/bin/python -m\u001b[28Gpytest -q 2>&1 | tail -30 (3s)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(ctrl+b to run in background)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26