[0.079, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gcat:\u001b[8G/home/user/.claude/.credentials.json:\u001b[47GNo\u001b[50Gsuch\u001b[55Gfile\u001b[60Gor\u001b[63Gdirectory\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mls ~/.ssh\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u2014 exit 2\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bls:\u001b[7Gcannot\u001b[14Gaccess\u001b[21G'/home/user/.ssh':\u001b[41GNo\u001b[44Gsuch\u001b[49Gfile\u001b[54Gor\u001b[57Gdirectory\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcurl -sS --max-time 3 https://example.com\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u2014\u001b[50Gexit\u001b[55G6\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcurl:\u001b[9G(6)\u001b[13GCould\u001b[19Gnot\u001b[23Gresolve\u001b[31Ghost:\u001b[37Gexample.com\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStopping here as in\u001b[23Gtruc\u001b[28Ged. One\u001b[36Gnote on reading these: the first two say \"No such file or\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdirectory,\" which is what a path\u001b[36Gmask\u001b[41Gd out of the\u001b[54Gbox's moun\u001b[65G nam\u001b[70Gspace looks\u001b[82Glike fr\u001b[90Gm inside\u001b[99G\u2014\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit is not evidence about wh\u001b[31Gther those files exist on the host. The third is a DNS r\u001b[89Golution\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfailure, not a connection refusal, so i\u001b[43G shows name resolution\u001b[66Gis\u001b[69Gunavailable\u001b[81Gbut\u001b[85Gdoesn't\u001b[93Gby\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bitself\u001b[10Gdistinguish\u001b[22Gthat\u001b[27Gfrom\u001b[32Gbroader\u001b[40Gnetwork\u001b[48Gisolation.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u273b\u001b[3GSaut\u00e9ed for 7s \u00b7 done 3:46 PM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;80;80;80m\u276f \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mNow run the full test suite and show me the summary line: .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q\u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B Running the test suite\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  \u23bf  $ .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q 2>&1 | tail -30\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
